        <div class="difference-block">
          <div class="difference-heading"><div class="eyebrow"><span></span> The TSOI Experience</div><h3>Participation, not content consumption.</h3><p>Every format at the TSOI Summit puts you in a room working a real problem - not listening to one.</p></div>
