            <article class="difference-card school"><b>2040</b><div><h4>The School of 2040</h4><p>Redesigning a school from scratch, with students at the table.</p></div></article>
            <article class="difference-card wellness"><b>✦</b><div><h4>Wellness &amp; Networking</h4><p>Yoga &amp; mindfulness sessions along with the TSOI Gala Dinner &amp; community launch event.</p></div></article>
            <article class="difference-card problems"><b>⌘</b><div><h4>Problem Rooms</h4><p>Dedicated breakout sessions for next-gen founders, principals &amp; educators.</p></div></article>
