          <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-light"><span></span> Assistance</div>
          <h2>Frequently Asked <em>Questions</em></h2>
          <div class="faq-list">
            <article class="faq-item open"><button type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span>Who can attend The Schools of India Summit 2026?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>The Summit is open to everyone in education - school founders, directors and trustees, principals and academic heads, teachers and educators, EdTech founders, and anyone building or working in education.</p></div></article>
            <article class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Is accommodation included?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. Hotel accommodation is included for delegates.</p></div></article>
            <article class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Will delegates receive a participation kit?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. Every delegate receives a participation kit, along with plenty of takeaways to carry back to their school.</p></div></article>
            <article class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Are meals included?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. All meals on the day of the Summit are covered.</p></div></article>
            <article class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Can schools attend as a group?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. Schools can bring an entire school delegation. Request a call back and our team will help you plan it.</p></div></article>
            <article class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Is parking available, and how do I get to the venue?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>The Summit is in Pune this January. The exact venue will be announced soon, and parking and travel details will be shared along with it.</p></div></article>
            <article class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Can I transfer my ticket to someone else?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>No. Tickets are non-transferable.</p></div></article>
            <article class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Will there be takeaways from the sessions?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes - delegates will leave with plenty of practical takeaways from the Summit.</p></div></article>
          </div>
